flowchart LR
    %% the contradiction check in the sweep
    pairs[Candidate engram pairs] --> near{Similar enough?}
    near -->|no| skip[Skip]
    near -->|yes| nli[NLI model]
    nli --> label{Verdict}
    label -->|entailment| fine[No finding]
    label -->|neutral| fine
    label -->|contradiction| finding[Contradiction finding]
    finding --> evolve[Shown in evolve]
